   "hash": "48212ff05a5dd77c",
   "does": "Assesses a Load: no load → .clear; collects ratio, fatigue and monotony reasons; level .easier if sharpIncrease or heavyFatigue present, .holdPush for any other reason, else .clear.",
   "entry": null,
   "calls": [
    "Emuqu/Sources/Analysis/TrainingAdviceGate.swift::func TrainingAdviceGate.ratioReasons(_:)",
