   "hash": "6ca4280ded0c4fe7",
   "does": "One localized sentence for the dominant reason: .easier with a sharp ratio increase → 'Recent load is above your usual range — a lighter session…'; .easier from heavy fatigue alone → 'Carrying significant fatigue — consider a lighter session'; else aboveUsual → 'above average'; else monotonous → similarity line; else nil.",
